{%- comment -%} PanER · Препоръки (зарежда се асинхронно от продуктовата страница) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  capture show_price
    render 'paner-show-price'
  endcapture
  assign show_price = show_price | strip
-%}
{%- if recommendations.performed and recommendations.products_count > 0 -%}
  <ul role="list" class="paner-related__list">
    {%- for rp in recommendations.products limit: 4 -%}
      {%- render 'paner-related-item', product: rp, show_price: show_price -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
{%- endif -%}
